"","content":"The inspiration for the style is Tachibana Hibiki from Symphogear - it's intended to be a much more aggressive way of turning song into battle than Nightingale is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24174-mystictemplar","name":"MysticTemplar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24174_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T17:41:08-07:00","id":1250901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MysticTemplar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250530-peach-harmonious-godslayer-style?p=1250878#post1250878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The inspiration for the style is Tachibana Hibiki from Symphogear - it's intended to be a much more aggressive way of turning song into battle than Nightingale is.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had a feeling it might be her. But since she was just one of several magical girls of her kind, each with a different weapon and combat style...<br /> <br /> Have you considered designing a set of artifact armor with a number of shared Evocations, with unique Evocations representing the different in weapon/style?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T20:24:05-07:00","id":1250951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250530-peach-harmonious-godslayer-style?p=1250901#post1250901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you considered designing a set of artifact armor with a number of shared Evocations, with unique Evocations representing the different in weapon/style?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/718200-listen-to-my-song-harmonious-symphonic-regalia-artifact-3-armour\">Way ahead of you</a>.<br /> <br /> I want to reconfigure this a bit for Alchemical rework.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T05:27:03-07:00","id":1251030,"title":"","content":"I recently asked Vance about the ability to perma-kill spirits. He said(roughly) that making it too easy throws off the setting. I'd recommend using the same restrictions as the Immaculate MAs and have the use of the entire charm tree only be available to Exalted or those not bound by the terrestrial keyword. Also ditch the terrestrial restrictions on the ones you have. If you really want God-Bloods with essence to use this, then I'd say lock the spirit perma-killing behind the terrestrial keyword.<br /> <br /> Aside from that the style looks good. Very thematic","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hi, I'm Smiles With Fangs. I backed Exalted 3rd edition, but I can't make the image I have smaller so here's a kitten<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.sherv.net/cm/emoticons/cats/kitten-lick-smiley-emoticon.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> I made some Liminal Charms <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/774800-liminal-charms-creation\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> I made some Evocations for Wood Dragon's Claws <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/886214-evocations-for-spells-workshop?p=889463#post889463\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> I'm working on a splat for the Moonsilver Warriors <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/954420-the-moonsilver-warriors-peach\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8574-smileswithfangs","name":"SmilesWithFangs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8574_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T14:35:46-07:00","id":1251760,"title":"","content":"So I'll be honest, I'd interpreted the Nightingale capstone as permanently killing spirits, so it felt like something that MA could do at the top end.<br /> <br /> You do raise a good point, and it isn't like putting Terrestrial on the permanent death stops DBs from using it if they are sufficiently determined, so...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24174-mystictemplar","name":"MysticTemplar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24174_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}